      The band was becoming so popular, another tour was held. Tetsu decided to part ways with the band after the last live of this tour.             
      Many theories exist as to why he quit the band, but during a recent live in Taiwan with Kozi, 
      he mentioned that he just wanted to try a different style of music, which can be seen in his following projects. 
      He remains in good terms with the rest of the members, and remembers fondly his years with Malice Mizer.
